When software makes operational decisions without a human in the loop, regulators increasingly look to the deploying company — and its board — for accountability.

## Document the Design Choices

Clear records of what the system may decide, the limits it operates within, and how exceptions escalate are the first line of defence in any review.

## Test Like an Auditor

Independent scenario testing before each major release turns compliance from a paperwork exercise into evidence that controls actually work.
